        "id": "2073751185308414096",
        "text": "Taking the sleeper train to Hong Kong right now. Last time I took a sleeper was back in college, when high-speed rail just started, just that one Beijing-Tianjin line for Beijing 2008 Olympic. Now it covers the entire country, in less than 2 decades.\n\nStill feels a bit surreal that I can leave Shanghai, sleep through the night, and wake up in Hong Kong.\n\nThe gadgets next to my bunk are fun too: ambient light, reading light, hooks, and one hook deliberately labeled “glasses rack.” How many people in China wear glasses exactly! 😅",
